  + source inspection found no filesystem, network, process, ambient clock, thread, provider, notification, persistence, model, unsafe, or FPGA operation in temporal_runtime
  + Cargo dependency graph is unchanged
  + every accepted transition returns a new immutable value and exact root-bound receipt
  + all Calendar time, execution observations, and compiler fixture values are supplied input

